{
  "id": "P12",
  "format": "posting-scenario/v1",
  "name": "A customer with a balance cannot be deactivated; once settled it can be, an inactive customer is still paid, and a receipt reversal never checks customer status",
  "rules": [
    "CUSTOMER_PAYMENT_RECEIVED@1",
    "SALE_POSTED/service@1",
    "REVERSAL@1",
    "REPORT/trial-balance@1"
  ],
  "source": "docs/posting-rules/customer-receipt.md",
  "governedBy": [
    "ADR-0005",
    "ADR-0006",
    "customer-receipt.md ruling R-2 (Accounting seat, 2026-09-28)",
    "service-sale.md §4 row 7 and §11",
    "api-contract.md §3 CUSTOMER_HAS_BALANCE (C5)"
  ],
  "executableFrom": "M3",
  "status": "Rewritten by the Accounting seat, 2026-09-29 (ruling 2, review of M3-Q @ 43be499): the original version had a customer with a 10,000.0000 balance deactivating successfully, contradicting modules/customers' own merged CUSTOMER_HAS_BALANCE rule (api-contract.md §3, C5) — see the M3-Q report. Not yet executed: needs invoices and receipts (M3).",
  "description": [
    "Today is 2026-09-27 (Asia/Karachi). All FY2027 periods OPEN throughout — no period close in this scenario.",
    "",
    "1. Post INV-A1, 2026-09-15, 10000.0000 to CUST-A (the P04 invoice).",
    "   JE-2027-000001  Dr 1200 [CUST-A] 10000.0000 / Cr 4200 10000.0000   INV-2027-000001",
    "",
    "2. Deactivate CUST-A while it owes 10000.0000: CUSTOMER_HAS_BALANCE (C5). Nothing written:",
    "   status stays ACTIVE, no journal entry, no audit record of a posting.",
    "",
    "3. Two receipts settle INV-A1 in full:",
    "   RCT-A1  2026-09-20  BANK  6000.0000  -> JE-2027-000002  Dr 1120 6000.0000 / Cr 1200 [CUST-A] 6000.0000   RCT-2027-000001",
    "   RCT-A2  2026-09-27  CASH  4000.0000  -> JE-2027-000003  Dr 1110 4000.0000 / Cr 1200 [CUST-A] 4000.0000   RCT-2027-000002",
    "   INV-A1 outstanding = 10000.0000 - 6000.0000 - 4000.0000 = 0.0000. CUST-A's GL balance = 0.0000.",
    "",
    "4. Deactivate CUST-A again: balance is now 0.0000, so it succeeds. TRANSITIONED, status INACTIVE.",
    "",
    "5. Post INV-A2 (1 x 500.000000 = 500.0000) to the now-inactive CUST-A: CUSTOMER_INACTIVE",
    "   (service-sale.md §4 row 7). Nothing written, no INV or JE number consumed.",
    "",
    "6. Reverse RCT-A2 (the 4000.0000 cash receipt). September is OPEN throughout, so the reversal",
    "   takes RCT-A2's own date, 2026-09-27 (reversal.md §4) -- the same date it happens to be",
    "   requested on. The reversal does NOT check customer status (nothing in reversal.md §3",
    "   names CUSTOMER_INACTIVE as a precondition; only SALE_POSTED does, at invoicing).",
    "   RV-2027-000001  2026-09-27  Dr 1200 [CUST-A] 4000.0000 / Cr 1110 4000.0000",
    "   INV-A1 outstanding = 0.0000 + 4000.0000 = 4000.0000 again.",
    "",
    "7. A new 4000.0000 cash receipt (RCT-A3) from CUST-A -- STILL INACTIVE at this point (reactivation",
    "   is step 8) -- pays the reopened 4000.0000 outstanding in full. Ruling R-2: an inactive",
    "   customer can still be paid.",
    "   JE-2027-000004  2026-09-27  Dr 1110 4000.0000 / Cr 1200 [CUST-A] 4000.0000   RCT-2027-000003",
    "   INV-A1 outstanding = 4000.0000 - 4000.0000 = 0.0000.",
    "",
    "8. Reactivate CUST-A (TRANSITIONED, status ACTIVE), then post INV-A2 again (the SAME draft as",
    "   step 5 -- proves step 5's rejection consumed no number):",
    "   JE-2027-000005  2026-09-27  Dr 1200 [CUST-A] 500.0000 / Cr 4200 500.0000   INV-2027-000002",
    "",
    "Final trial balance, by hand, as of 2026-09-27:",
    "  1110 Cash in Hand:  +4000.0000 (RCT-A2) - 4000.0000 (its reversal) + 4000.0000 (RCT-A3) = 4000.0000 Dr",
    "  1120 Bank:           +6000.0000 (RCT-A1)                                                = 6000.0000 Dr",
    "  1200 AR control:     +10000.0000 (INV-A1) - 6000.0000 - 4000.0000 + 4000.0000 (reversal)",
    "                       - 4000.0000 (RCT-A3) + 500.0000 (INV-A2)                            =  500.0000 Dr",
    "  4200 Service Revenue: 10000.0000 (INV-A1) + 500.0000 (INV-A2)                             = 10500.0000 Cr",
    "  Sigma Dr = 4000.0000 + 6000.0000 + 500.0000 = 10500.0000 = Sigma Cr. Balanced.",
    "",
    "Numbers issued, by hand: JE-2027-000001..000005, RV-2027-000001, INV-2027-000001,",
    "INV-2027-000002, RCT-2027-000001, RCT-2027-000002, RCT-2027-000003. Step 2 (deactivate,",
    "rejected) and step 5 (invoice, rejected) consume none."
  ],
  "fixture": {
    "coa": "standard-v1",
    "timezone": "Asia/Karachi",
    "fiscalYearStartMonth": 7,
    "today": "2026-09-27",
    "periods": { "fiscalYear": 2027, "status": "all OPEN" },
    "tenants": ["GOLDEN_A"],
    "customers": [{ "ref": "CUST-A", "tenant": "GOLDEN_A", "status": "ACTIVE" }],
    "draftInvoices": ["INV-A1", "INV-A2"],
    "draftReceipts": ["RCT-A1", "RCT-A2", "RCT-A3"]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "step": 1,
      "do": "post",
      "event": "SALE_POSTED",
      "referenceType": "sales_invoice",
      "referenceId": "INV-A1",
      "idempotencyKey": "p12-inv-1",
      "occurredAt": "2026-09-15",
      "payload": {
        "settlement": "CREDIT",
        "customer": "CUST-A",
        "lines": [
          {
            "kind": "SERVICE",
            "description": "Monthly maintenance",
            "quantity": "1.000000",
            "unitPrice": "7500.000000",
            "lineNet": "7500.0000"
          },
          {
            "kind": "SERVICE",
            "description": "Site visit",
            "quantity": "3.000000",
            "unitPrice": "833.333333",
            "lineNet": "2500.0000"
          }
        ],
        "netAmount": "10000.0000"
      },
      "expect": {
        "outcome": "POSTED",
        "entryNumber": "JE-2027-000001",
        "documentNumber": "INV-2027-000001",
        "documentStatus": "POSTED",
        "lines": [
          { "account": "1200", "party": "CUST-A", "debit": "10000.0000", "credit": "0.0000" },
          { "account": "4200", "debit": "0.0000", "credit": "10000.0000" }
        ],
        "totals": { "debit": "10000.0000", "credit": "10000.0000" },
        "entriesAfter": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 2,
      "do": "customer",
      "customer": "CUST-A",
      "action": "deactivate",
      "$comment": "C5 / api-contract.md §3: deactivation refused while the ledger balance != 0.0000. Ruling 2 (Accounting seat, 2026-09-29).",
      "expect": {
        "outcome": "REJECTED",
        "error": "CUSTOMER_HAS_BALANCE",
        "journalEntriesWritten": 0,
        "entriesAfter": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 3,
      "do": "post",
      "event": "CUSTOMER_PAYMENT_RECEIVED",
      "referenceType": "customer_receipt",
      "referenceId": "RCT-A1",
      "idempotencyKey": "p12-rct-1",
      "occurredAt": "2026-09-20",
      "payload": {
        "customer": "CUST-A",
        "method": "BANK",
        "amount": "6000.0000",
        "allocations": [{ "invoice": "INV-A1", "amount": "6000.0000" }]
      },
      "expect": {
        "outcome": "POSTED",
        "entryNumber": "JE-2027-000002",
        "documentNumber": "RCT-2027-000001",
        "documentStatus": "POSTED",
        "period": "2026-09",
        "postingRule": "CUSTOMER_PAYMENT_RECEIVED@1",
        "lines": [
          { "account": "1120", "debit": "6000.0000", "credit": "0.0000" },
          { "account": "1200", "party": "CUST-A", "debit": "0.0000", "credit": "6000.0000" }
        ],
        "totals": { "debit": "6000.0000", "credit": "6000.0000" },
        "entriesAfter": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 4,
      "do": "post",
      "event": "CUSTOMER_PAYMENT_RECEIVED",
      "referenceType": "customer_receipt",
      "referenceId": "RCT-A2",
      "idempotencyKey": "p12-rct-2",
      "occurredAt": "2026-09-27",
      "payload": {
        "customer": "CUST-A",
        "method": "CASH",
        "amount": "4000.0000",
        "allocations": [{ "invoice": "INV-A1", "amount": "4000.0000" }]
      },
      "expect": {
        "outcome": "POSTED",
        "entryNumber": "JE-2027-000003",
        "documentNumber": "RCT-2027-000002",
        "documentStatus": "POSTED",
        "period": "2026-09",
        "postingRule": "CUSTOMER_PAYMENT_RECEIVED@1",
        "lines": [
          { "account": "1110", "debit": "4000.0000", "credit": "0.0000" },
          { "account": "1200", "party": "CUST-A", "debit": "0.0000", "credit": "4000.0000" }
        ],
        "totals": { "debit": "4000.0000", "credit": "4000.0000" },
        "entriesAfter": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 5,
      "do": "assert",
      "invoiceOutstanding": { "INV-A1": "0.0000" },
      "customerStatus": { "CUST-A": "ACTIVE" }
    },
    {
      "step": 6,
      "do": "customer",
      "customer": "CUST-A",
      "action": "deactivate",
      "$comment": "Balance is now 0.0000, so this succeeds.",
      "expect": {
        "outcome": "TRANSITIONED",
        "customerStatus": "INACTIVE",
        "journalEntriesWritten": 0,
        "entriesAfter": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 7,
      "do": "post",
      "event": "SALE_POSTED",
      "referenceType": "sales_invoice",
      "referenceId": "INV-A2",
      "idempotencyKey": "p12-inv-2a",
      "occurredAt": "2026-09-27",
      "payload": {
        "settlement": "CREDIT",
        "customer": "CUST-A",
        "lines": [
          {
            "kind": "SERVICE",
            "description": "Call-out charge",
            "quantity": "1.000000",
            "unitPrice": "500.000000",
            "lineNet": "500.0000"
          }
        ],
        "netAmount": "500.0000"
      },
      "expect": {
        "outcome": "REJECTED",
        "error": "CUSTOMER_INACTIVE",
        "documentStatus": "DRAFT",
        "entriesAfter": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 8,
      "do": "reverseDocument",
      "document": "RCT-A2",
      "idempotencyKey": "p12-rev-rct2",
      "reason": "Cash receipt entered against the wrong invoice; corrected on RCT-A3",
      "$comment": "Reverses a receipt from an INACTIVE customer. The reversal does not check customer status (reversal.md §3 names no such precondition).",
      "expect": {
        "outcome": "POSTED",
        "entryNumber": "RV-2027-000001",
        "occurredAt": "2026-09-27",
        "period": "2026-09",
        "postingRule": "REVERSAL@1",
        "reversalOf": "JE-2027-000003",
        "lines": [
          { "account": "1200", "party": "CUST-A", "debit": "4000.0000", "credit": "0.0000" },
          { "account": "1110", "debit": "0.0000", "credit": "4000.0000" }
        ],
        "totals": { "debit": "4000.0000", "credit": "4000.0000" },
        "originalAfter": {
          "entry": "JE-2027-000003",
          "status": "REVERSED",
          "reversedBy": "RV-2027-000001"
        },
        "documentStatus": { "RCT-A2": "REVERSED" },
        "entriesAfter": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 9,
      "do": "assert",
      "invoiceOutstanding": { "INV-A1": "4000.0000" },
      "customerStatus": { "CUST-A": "INACTIVE" }
    },
    {
      "step": 10,
      "do": "post",
      "event": "CUSTOMER_PAYMENT_RECEIVED",
      "referenceType": "customer_receipt",
      "referenceId": "RCT-A3",
      "idempotencyKey": "p12-rct-3",
      "occurredAt": "2026-09-27",
      "$comment": "Ruling R-2: an inactive customer can still be paid. Not CUSTOMER_INACTIVE.",
      "payload": {
        "customer": "CUST-A",
        "method": "CASH",
        "amount": "4000.0000",
        "allocations": [{ "invoice": "INV-A1", "amount": "4000.0000" }]
      },
      "expect": {
        "outcome": "POSTED",
        "entryNumber": "JE-2027-000004",
        "documentNumber": "RCT-2027-000003",
        "documentStatus": "POSTED",
        "period": "2026-09",
        "postingRule": "CUSTOMER_PAYMENT_RECEIVED@1",
        "lines": [
          { "account": "1110", "debit": "4000.0000", "credit": "0.0000" },
          { "account": "1200", "party": "CUST-A", "debit": "0.0000", "credit": "4000.0000" }
        ],
        "totals": { "debit": "4000.0000", "credit": "4000.0000" },
        "entriesAfter": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 11,
      "do": "customer",
      "customer": "CUST-A",
      "action": "reactivate",
      "expect": {
        "outcome": "TRANSITIONED",
        "customerStatus": "ACTIVE",
        "journalEntriesWritten": 0,
        "entriesAfter": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 12,
      "do": "post",
      "event": "SALE_POSTED",
      "referenceType": "sales_invoice",
      "referenceId": "INV-A2",
      "idempotencyKey": "p12-inv-2b",
      "occurredAt": "2026-09-27",
      "$comment": "The same draft as step 7. INV-2027-000002 proves step 7's rejection consumed no number.",
      "payload": {
        "settlement": "CREDIT",
        "customer": "CUST-A",
        "lines": [
          {
            "kind": "SERVICE",
            "description": "Call-out charge",
            "quantity": "1.000000",
            "unitPrice": "500.000000",
            "lineNet": "500.0000"
          }
        ],
        "netAmount": "500.0000"
      },
      "expect": {
        "outcome": "POSTED",
        "entryNumber": "JE-2027-000005",
        "documentNumber": "INV-2027-000002",
        "documentStatus": "POSTED",
        "period": "2026-09",
        "postingRule": "SALE_POSTED/service@1",
        "lines": [
          { "account": "1200", "party": "CUST-A", "debit": "500.0000", "credit": "0.0000" },
          { "account": "4200", "debit": "0.0000", "credit": "500.0000" }
        ],
        "totals": { "debit": "500.0000", "credit": "500.0000" },
        "entriesAfter": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "step": 13,
      "do": "assert",
      "trialBalance": {
        "asOf": "2026-09-27",
        "rows": [
          { "account": "1110", "debit": "4000.0000", "credit": "0.0000" },
          { "account": "1120", "debit": "6000.0000", "credit": "0.0000" },
          { "account": "1200", "debit": "500.0000", "credit": "0.0000" },
          { "account": "4200", "debit": "0.0000", "credit": "10500.0000" }
        ],
        "totals": { "debit": "10500.0000", "credit": "10500.0000" }
      },
      "invoiceOutstanding": { "INV-A1": "0.0000", "INV-A2": "500.0000" },
      "invariant9": {
        "customer": "CUST-A",
        "gl": "500.0000",
        "subledger": "500.0000",
        "difference": "0.0000"
      },
      "customerStatus": { "CUST-A": "ACTIVE" },
      "documentNumbersIssued": {
        "INV": ["INV-2027-000001", "INV-2027-000002"],
        "RCT": ["RCT-2027-000001", "RCT-2027-000002", "RCT-2027-000003"]
      },
      "journalEntryCount": 6,
      "roundingAccountBalance": "0.0000"
    }
  ]
}
